## Index — files in this system

```
README.md                — this file
SKILL.md                 — Agent Skill manifest (drop-in for Claude Code)
colors_and_type.css      — color & type tokens, semantic styles
fonts/                   — Montserrat Variable, Patrick Hand
assets/                  — logos, portrait, any other source visuals
preview/                 — design-system cards (rendered in the DS tab)
ui_kits/personal-site/   — UI kit: portfolio site components + index.html
```

> No slide template was supplied, so `slides/` is intentionally
> absent. Ask for one if you want a deck shell.

---

## Caveats

- Tone & content guidance is **proposed**, not validated against
  existing copy. Adjust freely.
- The portfolio UI kit is a **plausible recreation** for a one-person
  site, not a copy of an existing site. There was no existing site or
  Figma file to reference.
- Lucide is a substituted icon set; replace if a specific set is
  preferred.
